<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h1 class="display">Grant guidelines.</h1>
    <p class="section-p">What to know before sending a first inquiry.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h2 class="m0">Who we fund</h2>
    <p class="section-p">Grants go to 501(c)(3) organizations, not to individuals. We focus on Christian sacred spaces, with room for related work.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
    <div class="stack stack--sm">
      <h2 class="m0">What a grant can pay for</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Bell repair, rehanging, and new rings</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Tower frames, headstocks and fittings</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Electronic carillons for churches without bells</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Pipe organ restoration, purchase and tuning</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Rose windows, stained glass and leadwork</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-check icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Training artisans and apprentices in the sacred arts</li>
      </ul>
      {#- The note for churches without bells, her three sentences verbatim, here and not as a
          separate section (client, 2026-09-29). #}
      <p class="section-p guidelines__note">A church without a tower may still apply. An electronic carillon can ring the Call to Worship, the Angelus, weddings, and funerals. A grant may cover one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="stack stack--sm">
      <h2 class="m0">What it cannot</h2>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><i class="ph ph-x icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Requests from individuals</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-x icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Salaries, operating costs and debt</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-x icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>General building work unrelated to bells, organs or glass</li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-x icon icon--sm icon--brass" aria-hidden="true"></i>Political or campaign activity</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap stack">
    <h2 class="m0">How it goes</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Send a short inquiry.</li>
      <li>We will read all submissions and reply.</li>
      <li>If a request passes the first review, we will ask for additional information such as a proposal, budget plans, photographs, drawings, and a cost estimate.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>
